[common]
desc="<p>TunHook is a self-hosted port forwarding and reverse tunneling tool.</p><ul><li>Provides TCP / UDP / HTTP / HTTPS port mapping, unified gateway and frpc proxying, covering FRP, MEFrp, LoliaFrp and Cloudflare Tunnel;</li><li>Each tunnel has its own rate limit, connection cap, PROXY protocol v2, upstream TLS, UDP session parameters, logs and IP filtering;</li><li>Built-in TLS certificate issuance and renewal, DNS record management, IP geolocation database, tunnel health checks and webhook notifications;</li><li>Custom error pages, navigation page, full backup and restore, dashboard layout and module toggles, with mobile layouts;</li><li>The ROOT edition adds one-click desktop icon packaging, Docker port scanning, connectivity tests and local direct-connection optimization.</li></ul>"
changelog="<ol><li>The console now supports Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, English and Japanese, switching instantly without a reload</li><li>The About changelog now has a version index and search with jump, filtering and match highlighting</li><li>Added a Support the developer entry with a tip QR code on the About page; the project homepage now points to tunhook.top and source links point to the GitHub repository</li><li>Added the missing v0.6.6.170 / v0.6.6.171 changelog entries and unified the version at 0.6.6.172</li></ol>"

